he apartment is ideal for up to three guests. 🌟 Whether you're seeking a quiet escape or a convenient base for exploration, this property is ready to welcome you.\n\n🏠 Apartment Features\nRelax in the thoughtfully furnished living space equipped with modern amenities. The apartment includes:\n\nA fully equipped kitchen with an oven, stovetop, and fridge, perfect for preparing meals. ☕\nA washing machine for added convenience during longer stays. 🧺\nFree WiFi and a flat-screen TV for entertainment and connectivity. 📡📺\nComplimentary bed linen and towels for a hassle-free move-in experience. 🛏️✨\n📍 Neighborhood Highlights\nSurrounded by the tranquil beauty of Brandenburg, the apartment is only:\n\n8 km from Nauen Train Station, connecting you to nearby cities. 🚆\nA short distance from charming local restaurants like Restaurant Stägehaus (6 km) and Asia Imbiss (8 km). 🍴\nA convenient 38 km from the stunning Park Sanssouci and Sanssouci Palace in Potsdam, perfect for day trips. 🏰\nExtra Information\nWith free private parking and easy access to public transport, this apartment combines comfort and practicality. Ideal for a peaceful getaway or an extended stay, it offers everything you need to feel at home in the beautiful Brandenburg region.\n\n💬 Don’t wait—send a message now to make this charming apartment your next home! 🌟","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"shared"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchen